  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.2.2-beta.7`\n\n### UI and usability\n\n- enhance tab splitting functionality with new directions and improve context menu localization ([fc949607](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/fc949607fe6eccbb39aa3833256018dde79666cb))\n- enhance tab width configuration with adaptive and standard modes, including UI adjustments and localization updates ([96d366b8](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/96d366b801dbad287562b33fa8aa92e414ef0a47))\n- enhance workspace dock theme and improve separator visibility for a cleaner UI ([c1b752ce](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c1b752cebe589beeb95b64aec7297c998b4d0002))\n- enhance TooltipContent positioning logic and improve tooltip viewport handling ([29997f9c](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/29997f9cb821a48f0fb1ba18b46ce9787587a6c7))\n- enhance tab focus styles and adjust workspace tab dimensions for improved accessibility ([8e6d866d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/8e6d866dfa8a63f6d65c8fd13bbc0c4d4aecef8f))\n- enhance DialogContent component with overlay properties and interaction handling ([42e690cd](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/42e690cdf00a50d3251c2b906ba9acc96716d62f))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.2.2-beta.7...v0.2.2-beta.8](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.2.2-beta.7...v0.2.2-beta.8)\n",
